# The build context is the repo root, so this allowlists rather than
# excludes: nothing reaches the image unless it is named here, which keeps
# .env, the live data directories and the portal out of it. Both servers are
# named because one recipe builds either; server.Dockerfile copies only the
# app its APP build arg selects.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!tsconfig.server.json
!libs/server-common
!libs/wire
!apps/stripe-bridge
!apps/fleet-monitor
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.test.ts
# Re-including a whole app directory would otherwise carry along a local .env
# or a copy of a live database dropped there to run against.
**/.env*
**/*.db*
